msgstr "Ja"

#: lib/bluetooth-settings-widget.c:1196
msgid "No"
msgstr "Niy"

#. translators: first %s is the name of the computer, for example:
#. * Visible as “Bastien Nocera’s Computer” followed by the
#. * location of the Downloads folder.
#: lib/bluetooth-settings-widget.c:1297
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Visible as “%s” and available for Bluetooth file transfers. Transferred "
"files are placed in the <a href=\"%s\">Downloads</a> folder."
msgstr ""
"Kōmputer je widzialny za „%s” i może przesyłać zbiory bez Bluetooth. "
"Przisłane zbiory bydōm wrażane do katalogu <a href=\"%s\">Pobrane</a>."

#: lib/bluetooth-settings-widget.c:1321
#, c-format
msgid "Remove “%s” from the list of devices?"
msgstr "Skasować maszina „%s” z listy?"

#: lib/bluetooth-settings-widget.c:1323
msgid ""
"If you remove the device, you will have to set it up again before next use."
msgstr ""
"Jak maszina bydzie skasowano, to na nastympny roz trza bydzie jōm "
"skōnfigurować zaś."

#: lib/bluetooth-settings-widget.c:1327
msgid "_Remove"
msgstr "_Skasuj"

